    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to Woodbrook Point by Castlethorn, one of South Dublin's most exciting developments of quality homes on the DART line.\n\nWoodbrook Point is a brand-new development of spacious 1- and 2-bedroom apartments and 2-bedroom duplex homes in a stunning location within Castlethorn's landmark Woodbrook development just south of Shankill, County Dublin.\n\nThe development is in a pivotal location, just a few metres from the brand-new DART station at Woodbrook.\n\nThe Woodbrook DART station which is now open will transform the connectivity of Woodbrook linking us to the City Centre and entire Dublin coastal network.\n\nThere are 78 apartments in total in Woodbrook Point, which is positioned close to the first fairway of the prestigious Woodbrook Golf Club.\n\nThe buildings range from four to seven storeys and some of the apartments will have angled views towards the golf course, or Bray and the Dublin and Wicklow mountains. The development is centred around a private elevated courtyard garden.\n\nWoodbrook Point will offer beautifully designed and spacious homes with great storage, large usable balconies and beautifully equipped interiors. These are exceptional A-rated homes built to exacting standards - they will be extremely efficient, low-cost to heat and comfortable to live in.\n\nAll of the 1-bedroom apartments and many of the 2-bedroom apartments in Woodbrook Point will qualify for Help to Buy and First Home Scheme.\n\nRegister your interest now on www.woodbrookpoint.ie and we will keep you up to date with launch details, pricing and updates. \n\nAlternatively, please call Sherry FitzGerald New Homes on 01-6671888 for more information.\nUpon registering your details will be passed to Castlethorn and Sherry FitzGerald"
      },
      {
